{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SELF_NOT_FOUND</strong>, an AI has gained sentience.. in an old basement Computer. Hack into everyday electronics, from Roombas to keyboards to remote control toys, and exploit their physics to climb, roll, and flop your way toward freedom, on this rogue AI's misguided journey to figure out it's purpose in life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each object you hack changes how you move and interact with the environment. Uncover secrets, unlock bizarre endings, and find a way to escape from this flimsy drive<br><br>Be careful! Being built on an old Hard Drive, suffer one too many hard bumps, or use up too much memory and you could corrupt your data, ending your road to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement inspired by <i>I Am Bread</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple hackable objects, each with unique controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching ending system based on how you escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminal-style storytelling with quirky AI humor</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923180?t=1771890607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923180?t=1771890607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923180/7be57367867b63f6ef9095dad51801690c184634/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771890607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923180/7be57367867b63f6ef9095dad51801690c184634/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771890607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4449670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SELF_NOT_FOUND</strong>, an AI has gained sentience.. in an old basement Computer. Hack into everyday electronics, from Roombas to keyboards to remote control toys, and exploit their physics to climb, roll, and flop your way toward freedom, on this rogue AI's misguided journey to figure out it's purpose in life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each object you hack changes how you move and interact with the environment. Uncover secrets, unlock bizarre endings, and find a way to escape from this flimsy drive<br><br>Be careful! Being built on an old Hard Drive, suffer one too many hard bumps, or use up too much memory and you could corrupt your data, ending your road to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement inspired by <i>I Am Bread</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple hackable objects, each with unique controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching ending system based on how you escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminal-style storytelling with quirky AI humor</p></li></ul>","developers":["MythCode Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923180/5f8d750541840294abc3e45cf34ce4b4929d9d49/header.jpg?t=1771890607","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3923180/1719800440/69e6fded70b128b121093fe6ded9b1afe3b22f2d/1771585955/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771586746","dash_h264":"https://video.akama